Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" link
Type "Pregnant" in the "sstring" input
Click the "Search" button
Open the quicklink list
Click the "Add Order" quicklink
Begin "Order Request"
	Select "Selenium, Selenium" from the "ordering_physician" dropdown
	#do this twice because we want to check a both Yes and No in the "duplcate orders is this okay" miewin.confirm
	Enter "ANA" in the "ordersac_txt" autocomplete
	Type "first" in the 1st "comment_442" input
	Enter "ANA" in the "ordersac_txt" autocomplete
	Type "second" in the 2nd "comment_442" input
	Click the "ANA" picklist checkbox
	Click the "BUN" picklist checkbox

	#make sure we detect multiples and No takes the user back
	Click the "Submit" button
	Verify exists "3 instances of ANA" text
	Click the "No" button

	Verify exists "Additional Orders" text

	#make sure we detect multiples and Yes lets the user finish
	#YUCK!!!!
	Click the "Submit" button
	Verify exists "3 instances of ANA" text
	Click the "Yes" button

@Switch Windows@driver.switchToPopup()
#should be two of these -- how to check?
Verify exists "ANA (first)" text
Verify exists "ANA (second)" text
Verify exists "BUN" text
@@@Switch Back to New Requisition Screen
driver.miedb.dbExec(f"UPDATE preferences SET preference_value=1 WHERE user_id=0 AND preference_name='Use New Requisition Screen'")
